&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. When determining base pay as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training.&amp;nbsp;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$107,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$133,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for a proactive and detail-driven Manager, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&amp;nbsp;to join our team. In this role, you’ll ensure our people practices are fair, consistent, and compliant with federal, state, and local and international employment laws. This is a great opportunity for someone who thrives on building structure, staying ahead of regulatory changes, and balancing risk management with a great employee experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and oversee our background check program—manage vendor relationships, design packages, partner with each operating company on business process documentation and escalation procedures, and ensure compliance with FCRA, EEOC, and state/local requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage I-9 compliance and related process improvements to ensure accurate documentation and ongoing audit readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR, Legal, and Talent Acquisition to apply compliance standards throughout the employee lifecycle—from hiring to offboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee employment law compliance across areas such as leaves, salary transparency, notice requirements, and recordkeeping, ensuring timely policy and training updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal on the development and maintenance of domestic and international employment policies, including for Canada, Australia, and France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reviews and audits of restrictive covenant agreements and employee offboarding protocols to ensure consistency and legal compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Payroll and HR Operations to maintain compliance with pay, tax, and reporting obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct internal audits and maintain accurate records to reduce risk and support reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to HR and business leaders, fostering understanding and accountability around compliance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that make compliance not just a requirement, but part of our culture of fairness and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of HR compliance, employee relations, or background screening experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of U.S. employment laws and background check regulations (FCRA, EEOC, ban-the-box laws, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with third-party background screening vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative partner who can balance compliance requirements with business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment, attention to detail, and ability to explain complex rules in plain language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR certification (SHRM-CP, SHRM-SCP, PHR, or SPHR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a multi-state or global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Oracle HR systems (HRIS, ATS, compliance tracking tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Achieving our goals requires strong collaboration and partnership between our teams and our internal stakeholders. To best support this, the person who accepts this role is expected to be on site, in office four days per week. To provide our employees with flexibility, we offer a unique benefit where employees at Fanatics&#39; corporate entity can work remotely for up to four weeks per year, which can be taken in daily or weekly increments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. When determining base pay as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training.&amp;nbsp;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Backend Engineer at Fanatics Core, you&#39;ll design, develop, test, and maintain scalable, high-quality systems to deliver exceptional customer experiences. We own the Fanatics App, the brand-forward application of Fanatics that encompasses elements of all of our different brands and businesses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We own the Fanatics App, the mobile app at&amp;nbsp; Fanatics that encompasses elements from&amp;nbsp; all of our different brands and businesses. The Fanatics App brings together Free to Play games, live events, ecommerce, and new product experiences to deliver a best-in-class&amp;nbsp; Sports platform. Fundamentally, we are one team in everything we do, from the user experience to coding and architecture. We aim to deliver on our Customer Promise by delighting our millions of monthly active users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, test, document, and deploy high quality software into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build features and tools that you and your team use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the on-call rotation when needed to troubleshoot software issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate when tasks or projects hit roadblocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews to maintain code quality and share knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team planning and design discussions, building more expertise around design approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact software quality and customer experience of product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve testability, operational excellence metrics, and team documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help your team define and adhere to the principles, guidelines, and best practices of our engineering strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a fundamental understanding of our industry, product, feature set and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our product team and other internal stakeholders to make technology decisions that grow and improve our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to onboard and mentor junior engineers and interns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain current on the latest technologies and trends in software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be open to occasional travel to Fanatics offices and other locations for conferences, events, meetings, and team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; building highly scalable, performant and evolvable backend distributed systems; proficiency in Spring with Kotlin and/or Java is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ability&lt;/strong&gt; to drive best practices in backend development and mentor others in effective coding and architectural strategies, such as clean code, hexagonal/layered architectures, domain driven design and other design and architectural patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge of observability practices&lt;/strong&gt;, including logging, monitoring, and tracing in distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise in Agile software delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of modeling and driving process improvements across teams, and ability to collaborate cross-functionally across diverse teams within large enterprise environments, driving alignment and shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, capable of conveying complex technical concepts clearly and effectively to diverse audiences, including engineers, executives, and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team-first mentality&lt;/strong&gt;, with a willingness to do what it takes to get the job done and a desire to strive for better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrives in a high-growth&lt;/strong&gt; environment where priorities evolve regularly and decisions are made quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Experience&lt;/strong&gt; in the sports industry, gaming and content delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly effective&lt;/strong&gt; with Kotlin, Java and/or Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise in messaging technologies&lt;/strong&gt; such as Kafka or Amazon SQS, with a solid understanding of event-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable working with&lt;/strong&gt; Cloud Native and Infrastructure as Code, like Kubernetes, Helm and Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to work in diverse&lt;/strong&gt; codebases, both legacy and greenfield, in different languages and environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you possess some of these qualifications but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-AC2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ranges will change based on country and state of residence, which are reflected in Geographical Zones defined by Fanatics Betting and Gaming. The range incorporates all of our Geographical Compensation Zones and is subject to change as the Zone associated with the actual offer is confirmed. In addition to the base and bonus, full-time employment, and more. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$121,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every time a fan places a bet, earns a reward, or checks out on Fanatics — Fanatics Core made that possible. We build the shared foundations — identity, payments, loyalty, wallet, data, and platform — that power sports betting, ecommerce, collectibles, and beyond. We supercharge the business by providing products and capabilities so that teams can focus on what matters most: building delightful experiences for the fans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics is uniquely positioned at the intersection of sports commerce, betting, and collectibles, and Fanatics ONE is the loyalty and identity program that ties it all together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Overview&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer at Fanatics, you will design, build, and operate the platforms and services that power the Fan Ecosystem — the systems that connect fans to every Fanatics product and experience. You will own significant technical surface area end to end, set the technical direction for projects that span multiple services and teams, and raise the engineering bar for those around you through mentorship, design leadership, and hands-on delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, full-stack role with a backend center of gravity. The majority of your work will be building high-throughput, high-availability services in Go, with meaningful contributions to the TypeScript/React front ends those services support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, document, and operate high-quality, production-grade software with a focus on Go services and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical design of medium-to-large features and systems: define the approach, weigh trade-offs, document decisions, and drive them to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down ambiguous problems into well-scoped, deliverable work for yourself and other engineers on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and participate in design and architecture reviews; provide clear, constructive feedback that improves both the design and the designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard in code reviews — for correctness, readability, testability, and operational safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and grow engineers on the team; onboard new hires and act as a technical point of contact for your systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in and improve the on-call rotation: instrument your services, drive incident response, and lead blameless postmortems that result in real fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve reliability, performance, and cost of the systems you own; define and act on SLOs and operational excellence metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and pay down technical debt, and make the case for the investments worth making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product managers, designers, and stakeholders to shape the roadmap and make technology decisions that grow the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence and help define the principles, guidelines, and best practices of our engineering strategy — then hold the team to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep understanding of our industry, product, feature set, and roadmap, and use it to make better technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional software engineering experience building and operating production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong, demonstrated proficiency in Go (Golang) — required.&lt;/strong&gt; You have built and shipped production services in Go and can speak to concurrency patterns, error handling, testing, profiling, and performance tuning in the language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing, building, and scaling backend services and APIs (REST and/or gRPC) in a distributed, microservices environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in JavaScript or TypeScript, and experience with React or another modern front-end framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in data stores and messaging: relational and/or NoSQL databases, caching, and event streaming (e.g. Kafka, SQS/SNS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, or Azure), containers, CI/CD, and infrastructure-as-code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational instincts: observability, monitoring, alerting, debugging production issues under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading projects with multiple contributors and delivering them on time without sacrificing quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Agile software product delivery and SCRUM methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to effectively work cross-functionally within an enterprise environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating with identity and access management systems — authentication, authorization, SSO, and account lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with identity standards and protocols: OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, SAML, JWT, MFA, session and token lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with identity providers and CIAM platforms (e.g. Okta, Auth0, ForgeRock, AWS Cognito, Ping) or with building an in-house identity platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with account security, fraud prevention, PII handling, or regulatory/compliance-driven engineering (KYC, GDPR, CCPA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing systems that serve high-traffic, consumer-facing products with spiky, event-driven load&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with platform or shared-services work where your consumers are other engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in sports, commerce, media, or another consumer-scale domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you possess some of these qualifications but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KR1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range represents base pay only and does not include short-term or long-term incentive compensation. When determining base pay as part of a final compensation package, we consider several factors such as location, experience, qualifications, and training.&amp;nbsp;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$121,600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Engineering Manager at Fanatics, you will be a technical leader with the ability to grow and scale engineering teams that can deliver business results and ship high-quality software for customer-facing products and internal platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We own the Fanatics App, the mobile app at Fanatics that encompasses elements from all of our different brands and businesses. The Fanatics App brings together Free to Play games, live events, ecommerce, and new product experiences to deliver a best-in-class Sports platform. Fundamentally, we are one team in everything we do, from the user experience to coding and architecture. We aim to deliver on our Customer Promise by delighting our millions of monthly active users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership and technical expertise within your engineering vertical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead one or more teams to deliver software while adhering (and contributing) to engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach, and develop engineers working across mobile and backend platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify technical requirements, negotiate priorities, and manage projects to deliver on time by leading daily scrum activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your product and design partners to create an ambitious, yet achievable roadmap that can be communicated to executives and stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliable and predictable team execution by setting clear objectives, using data and KPIs to drive transparency, and champion continuous improvement across engineering practices and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive effective adoption of AI-assisted engineering workflows, including development tooling, documentation, testing support, code review augmentation, and developer enablement best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear updates (KPIs, status, metrics) to an executive audience and key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to recruit, assess and onboard a diverse group of talented engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together stakeholders across Fanatics to align diverging ideas into an actionable roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain technically engaged in architecture discussions, operational reviews, development workflows, and engineering quality practices while empowering engineers to own implementation details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be open to occasional travel to Fanatics offices and other locations for conferences, events, meetings, and team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience managing one or more engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience building highly scalable and fault tolerant systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have knowledge of a broad range of design approaches and can deconstruct an architecture to be developed by different teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to scope a project with targeted dates to ensure your team meets business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows how to discern which features are essential, can be triaged, or omitted and works to negotiate with Product Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to effectively communicate complex technical subjects to a variety of audiences (engineers, technical leaders, marketing and operations teams, non-technical functional leaders)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Agile software product delivery and SCRUM methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid report writing skills with the ability to gather, evaluate and analyze relevant information while structuring material in a logical and coherent manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in an entrepreneurial, hyper-growth environment where priorities evolve regularly and decisions are made quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-first mentality, with a willingness to do what it takes to get the job done and a desire to strive for better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to effectively work cross-functionally within an enterprise environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mobile software engineering background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Kotlin Multiplatform and/or Compose Multiplatform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for sports cards, collectibles, or live commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you possess some of these qualifications but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-AC2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ranges will change based on country and state of residence, which are reflected in Geographical Zones defined by Fanatics Betting and Gaming. The range incorporates all of our Geographical Compensation Zones and is subject to change as the Zone associated with the actual offer is confirmed. In addition to the base and bonus, full-time employment, and more. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$163,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$265,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruiting-fraud@fanaticsinc.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

